                                                "sense_id": "8a7407f6-9ad9-3f5a-89b6-c7010b724cb1",
                                                "text": "[…] others are drawn, not as portraits, not strict copies of these most essential characteristic parts, but filled up afterwards from memory, and a general idea of an amass of arms, without the specific one of a trophæal amass, which is the fact of these bas-relieves."
